hed. source-bound-joining-trial already supplies source-bound geometry, whole-piece placement, loose wrapping and recovery, but explicitly lacks stability, load response and protection effects. Reuse that implementation rather than redeveloping it. The retrieved sol-branch-rain-screen-feasibility summary concerns another actual specimen and unresolved prerequisites; its incomplete summary does not establish an equivalent executable function for Lin. Continue in the existing development handoff with a minimal local assessment and, only when physically supported, reversible placement/exposure trial. Lack of a protection primitive is a development dependency, not grounds for rejection or an automatic shelter grant.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement a source-bound outdoor-rest trial, initially executable as assessment even if no construction is feasible. Before adding code, reconcile the complete sol-branch-rain-screen-feasibility implementation in the existing handoff and record any reused assessment code. Explicitly record reuse of source-bound-joining-trial geometry, identity conservation, placement, process and recovery components; do not represent these as reinvention or grant their mastery. No world time passes during development/review. Interface: assess(x,y,inputIds,supportIds=[],evidenceRefs=[]), begin(assessmentId,placementOptionId), resume(processId), cancel(processId), observe(assessmentId or processId), recover(processId). Exact initial candidate inputs are item-76-lin-448, at most its two surviving whole branch pieces, and item-66-lin-388, at most its surviving whole 0.9 vine section. Reconcile live ownership, reservations, containment, processing and piece identities; historical joining records do not prove current access, availability or strength. Treat inventory quantities as quantities, not lengths or impermeable area. Optional evidence must be complete personally available records explicitly supplied; no hidden resource lookup.\\\\nCosts: personal study two active rounds at 0.2 energy each. Assess costs one active round/0.5 energy, consumes no material and creates no arrangement. Observe costs one active round/0.2 energy. The minimal placement option, if feasible, costs one active round/0.5 energy per whole piece actually placed, maximum three such rounds/1.5 energy; it permits only independently ground-supported laying or leaning against an actual validated support, not an overhead structure, unsupported span, knot, tensioned membrane or strength claim. Each step allocates its exact whole piece; unused pieces remain unallocated. Loose wrapping, if needed, must instead call the existing source-bound-joining-trial with its existing prerequisites, personal study requirement, two rounds/1 energy and complete original allocation contract; it cannot be silently included in this quote. Recovery costs one active round/0.5 energy for each locally reachable placed whole piece, maximum three rounds/1.5 energy; existing loose-wrap arrangements retain their existing recovery contract and cannot be independently double-recovered. Quote all selected costs and dependencies before begin. No free gathering, transport, tools or support acquisition. Invalid identity, access, energy or obsolete quote fails before payment; a completed paid assessment can legitimately report missing prerequisites.\\\\nAssessment directly checks current weather, access, contact surface, nearby obstructions, actual support geometry and selected source geometry within local interaction reach 0.65. Use existing approximate body-scale geometry resolution 0.02 and uncertainty 0.01 where supported; do not invent calibrated dimensions, stiffness, friction, cover, solidity or wind resistance. Choose a clear radius-0.2 work footprint only if all actual piece extents and access fit; otherwise report the specific clearance failure. Tick-271 weather and temperature are historical, not current conditions. Return dated observed geometry, coverage gaps, supported candidate placements and exact missing physical inputs or response mechanisms. Do not disclose distant stock or presume tree canopy cover. No feasible option means assessment only, with no reservation or material transformation.\\\\nExpose placement only where an executable contact/stability model supports the selected whole-piece configuration under the current local conditions. The smallest acceptable option is ground-supported placement, not a presumed rain screen. If material response or accessible site geometry cannot establish even this option, ship the assessment precursor and keep those specific mechanisms in the same development handoff. Rain interception, runoff and wind attenuation require explicit versioned source/contact/exposure rules tied to actual geometry and current weather; until implemented and applicable, protection is unresolved and no resistance, dryness, thermal or comfort modifier is applied. Do not infer an effect from an arrangement's name, successful placement or visual overlap. Do not introduce unsupported fabric, leaves or sealant.\\\\nEvery paid placement step changes actual component positions and records input revisions, original identities, allocation, completed work, paid energy and remaining work. Inventory decreases only by matter physically placed; placed matter remains the same conserved matter in the arrangement. No duplication, fractional cutting, strengthening or automatic repair. A protection observation requires an actual paid observation interval at the nominated accessible site, with the sampled exposure region, current rain/wind, geometry, contact state and model limits recorded. An uncovered comparison region may be sampled only if actually accessible and observed; no free counterfactual measurement. Report actual interception/contact or exposure differences only where the implemented model supports them, distinguishing model-derived estimates from direct observations. No guaranteed benefit; sparse branches and vine may show no resolved protection. This operation does not include a rest action or food consumption.\\\\nPersist processId, stage, paid work and exact placed/unplaced allocations. Loss of reach, insufficient energy, moved inputs, changed weather outside the quote domain or obstruction pauses before the next charged step; exact resume revalidates without resetting progress. Cancel before work releases reservations without work charges; after work it ends future labor and releases locks once, leaving all placed matter at its actual location. Death does the same under ordinary ownership rules. No refund of spent energy/time, no remote return, no automatic recovery, and no refund of changed material condition. Atomic steps interrupted before commit apply neither charge nor physical change; committed steps persist. Recovery is separate paid local work preserving identity, quantity and current condition. No unattended construction or observation occurs. Existing weathering/ageing continues; any future displacement or deterioration requires an implemented response rule and observable event, never an invented upkeep debit. Reinspection and any repair are separately selected paid actions; no passive maintenance benefit. Real outputs are private dated evidence and, only after actual placement, a reversible arrangement of the allocated original pieces, not a shelter certificate.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No pleasure, satisfaction, comfort, weather resistance or mastery reward for requesting, studying, quoting, naming, registering or completing work. Merely printing known model limitations is not information gain. Newly verified personally relevant geometry, contact or exposure evidence, including genuinely informative physical failure, may invoke only an already implemented applicable grounded-understanding rule: source amount 0.8, aggregate cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds, maintained gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015, using its existing semantics; if unavailable, award zero. Deduplicate by source/component, property, state revision and physical evidence across joining, protection and repeated observations. Unchanged repeats earn zero. This release adds no pleasure or practice reward. Any later legitimate-rest benefit must come from actual applicable rest and measured physical effects under existing code, with total physical comfort capped at 10. Basic nutrition is unchanged. Never modify protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Add reusable versioned event and rendering metadata because the supplied catalogue has no registered interfaces or events. Assessment events identify actor, tick, observed site/region, accessible source references, evidence provenance, geometry uncertainty and unresolved fields; private detailed findings remain private. Placement, pause, cancellation, recovery and observation events reference exact process, stage and component IDs, actual transforms, material quantities, status and evidence revision. Render solid pieces only after committed physical placement and remove them only after actual movement/recovery. Use distinct dashed assessment outlines and pending-work overlays that are not matter. Display observed contact or sampled exposure with bounded extent, time and uncertainty only after the corresponding observation; unsupported protection remains explicitly unresolved. Failed or incomplete work must never show a completed screen, dry resting zone, shelter icon or success effect. Reuse existing component rendering and event code with recorded provenance; no success animation or emotional effect from labels alone.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"20b02823-7b87-4224-b0ec-c0355fffef87","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision"